<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Let’s pick it up, let’s pick it up,</l><l>If we see it on the ground, let’s pick it up.</l><l>(Oh, be faithful, faithful)</l><l>Let’s pick it up, let’s pick it up,</l><l>If we see it on the ground, let’s pick it up!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Take out the trash, take out the trash,</l><l>If we see that it is full, take out the trash.</l><l>(Oh, be faithful, faithful)</l><l>Take out the trash, take out the trash,</l><l>If we see that it is full, take out the trash!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Get the homework done, get the homework done,</l><l>Get it finished, get it over, get it done.</l><l>(Oh, be faithful, faithful)</l><l>Get the homework done, get the homework done,</l><l>Get it finished, get it over, get it done!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
